# Growth engine runtime state. The copy on the droplet is the source of truth —
# it is the measurement history and the record of what was tried, and a stale
# checkout overwriting it would erase the year's findings. seed.py and
# keywords.py recreate the baseline on a fresh install.
growth/techniques.json
growth/keywords.json
growth/results.jsonl
growth/state.json
growth/.anthropic_key
growth/.elevenlabs_key
# Caller numbers for calls already identified — personal data, and rebuildable
# from the ElevenLabs API, so it stays on the droplet.
growth/calls_cache.json
*.growth-bak
